{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22386","headline":"念金銮子二首 二 · 白居易","name":"念金銮子二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"与尔爲父子，八十有六旬。\n忽然又不见，迩来三四春。\n形质本非实，气聚偶成身。\n恩爱元是妄，缘合暂爲亲。\n念兹庶有悟，聊用遣悲辛。\n暂将理自夺，不是忘情人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22386.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22386","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}